# VAULT — Retentionvolt Secrets Checklist
# Questo file NON va mai su git. Tienilo solo in locale o su 1Password.
# Spunta ogni voce dopo averla impostata su Vercel: Settings > Environment Variables

# [ ] 1. Supabase — Dashboard > Project Settings > API
#      NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL = https://huntczcloqxacakekzvn.supabase.co
#      NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = eyJ... (anon, public — ok in NEXT_PUBLIC)
#      SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY = eyJ... (service_role — MAI NEXT_PUBLIC, solo server)
# [ ] 2. Stripe — Dashboard > Developers > API keys (Test mode)
#      NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY = pk_test_...
#      STRIPE_SECRET_KEY = sk_test_...  (ruota quella hardcoded vecchia!)
#      STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET = whsec_... (Stripe > Webhooks > Signing secret)
# [ ] 3. MCP — genera nuova:
#      MCP_API_KEY = rv_live_$(openssl rand -hex 16)
#      MCP_ALLOWED_ORIGINS = https://design-six-green.vercel.app
# [ ] 4. Google OAuth — Google Cloud Console > Credentials
#      NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID = xxx.apps.googleusercontent.com
#      GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET = GOCSPX-...
# [ ] 5. ElevenLabs — Dashboard > API
